# The gate trace can run to a hundred megabytes; the committed evidence is the screenshots
# and RESULT.md beside it (see e2e/gate-M6.live.ts).
artifacts/**/trace.zip
# …except a light one. M7п's trace carries the action and network log with per-action screenshots
# and DOM snapshots off, which is 88 KB rather than 107 MB — and task 110 asks for it to be kept.
!artifacts/gate-M7/trace.zip

# The etalon pages unpack from `.specs/research/etalon-design.zip` (committed beside it). Three
# megabytes of saved HTML that any reader can reproduce with one `unzip` is not history worth
# keeping twice.
.specs/research/etalon-design/

# The customer's screen recordings — reference material, handed over on this machine.
